From u99a06696c483481a at groups.google.com  Mon May 18 18:57:42 2020
From: u99a06696c483481a at groups.google.com (Edward Rigdon)
Date: Mon, 18 May 2020 18:57:42 +0000
Subject: Re: Specifying an estimator when invoking Lavaan with a covariance matrix
